<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25-0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25-0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$0.25-0.50 lower. Trading slow. Top $59.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   58.75-59.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   58.25-58.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   57.25-58.25</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   55.25-57.25</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   54.25-55.25</p>
<p>Sows 300-500 lbs 1.00 higher, 500-550 lbs 0.50 higher, 550-650</p>
<p>lbs steady to 0.50 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>	    500-550 lbs    48.50</p>
<p>	    550-650 lbs    49.00-49.50</p>
</text>
